      <title>CodeAstro Simple Attendance Management System 1.0 — SQL Injection Auth Bypass (CVE-2026-37749)</title>
      <link>http://192.168.0.124:1313/pocs/web/2026-07-05_cve-2026-37749-attendance-management-sqli-authbypass/</link>
